                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "028d9b40-b4c6-3828-a10a-d248e43b5ea6",
                                        "entry_id": "27a1c63c-c8a0-3710-97e1-58bf8f64b5d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ordinary (geometric design) in the shape of an X. It usually occupies the entire field in which it is placed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b1e0b51-4da4-3ef1-9a47-bbc0f8168830",
                                        "entry_id": "27a1c63c-c8a0-3710-97e1-58bf8f64b5d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Saint Andrew's cross, the flag of Scotland."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88a6c55d-e05d-4a41-9116-508d61ae82c7",
                                                "sense_id": "1b1e0b51-4da4-3ef1-9a47-bbc0f8168830",
                                                "text": "But the World Cup winning veteran's left boot was awry again, the attempt sliced horribly wide of the left upright, and the saltires were waving aloft again a moment later when a long pass in the England midfield was picked off to almost offer up a breakaway try."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e34fe1d-03b0-40ee-bb25-dc5d6bdf435a",
                                                "sense_id": "1b1e0b51-4da4-3ef1-9a47-bbc0f8168830",
                                                "text": "It was early August. In the Borders, there were few signs yet of a campaign that could take Scotland out of the United Kingdom. A large Y-E-S hung in separate letters from a tree on the road from Coldstream to Kelso. There wasn't a N-O to match it, but Kelso town hall flew both the saltire and the union jack."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9d1dd2f-7154-332f-bed0-27e5aabf395e",
                                        "entry_id": "27a1c63c-c8a0-3710-97e1-58bf8f64b5d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Saint Patrick's Cross, the pre 1922 flag of Ireland."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bf0d277-bad4-4497-a4f6-ba897d551f6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "4237d1b8-c5db-301a-a4cf-7039e3ac54ab",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1b0eb52-0dac-3c5d-b611-693e728163d4",
